From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: amber <amber@flourish.ch>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 18:49:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/26] Add opt-in diagnostic logging

Keep logging disabled by default, apply changes without a restart, clear local logs and crash reports when disabled, and disable the Debug Log menu item while no logs are being collected.

Adapted from Molly work by Oscar Mira and other Molly contributors.

Signed-off-by: amber <amber@flourish.ch>
